--- !u!114 &1051981816
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 247845671}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7959598fb026fa143bcbf50a75d232bd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  initInteraction: {fileID: 1051981817}
  dialoguePlayer: {fileID: 1271016236}
  allItems: 4
  curItems: 0
  introLines:
  - 'Ponter: Well, this looks like the thing we''re looking for.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I wonder if there are still people that come to places like this.'
  - 'Ponter: Like Magnus?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Well, obviously... But besides him.'
  - '!<NAME>!: I mean you can''t be sure, though. He could have been bestowed the
    Devil power somewhere else.'
  - '!<NAME>!: This isn''t the only place the book mentioned.'
  - 'Ponter: Alright, anyway. This seems to be the right place. '
  - 'Ponter: But what are we supposed to do now?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Let me check the book.'
  - '!<NAME>!: ...'
  - '!<NAME>!: Okay, I''ve got it.'
  - '!<NAME>!: The book mentions that the previous adventurers had to make a sacrifice.'
  - 'Ponter: Oh, man... What is it?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Remains of the worshippers.'
  - 'Ponter: We don''t worship the Devil. So now what?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Wait, did you just consider taking me out?'
  - 'Ponter: No! Not at all! That''s just the first answer I came up with.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Yeah, sure... Anyway.'
  - '!<NAME>!: The previous adventurers were lucky enough to have a dozen of worshippers
    in here when they got here.'
  - '!<NAME>!: Ehm... They slaughtered all of them.'
  - 'Ponter: That''s brutal... I don''t think I''d be able to do something like this.'
  - 'Ponter: Anyway the only worshipper we know of is Magnus... And he''s not here.'
  - 'Ponter: But wait! They slaughered a bunch of worshippers right here!'
  - 'Ponter: Perhaps their remains can still be found here.'
  - 'Ponter: What do you think?'
  - '!<NAME>!: Hmm... There were four horsemen of the Apocalypse, right? '
  - '!<NAME>!: Maybe remains of four different people, or four different body parts
    would suffice?'
  - 'Ponter: Sounds good to me. I don''t want to spend who knows how long here...'
  - '!<NAME>!: Let''s get to work, then.'
  moveToCutscene: {fileID: 1031691465}
  digging: {fileID: 540817761}
  blackoutManager: {fileID: 1374672804}
  cutscene: {fileID: 68606136}
  unlockAtlantis:
  - 'Ponter: This must be the entry to Atlantis!'
  - 'Ponter: Let''s not waste any time!'
  - 'Ponter: Let''s go!'
  entryCutscene: {fileID: 1078750455}
